---
// Geist has no arrow glyphs, so a system fallback would render "↗" inconsistently. An inline SVG stays crisp and aligned with the text.
---

<svg
  class='ml-[0.3em] inline-block size-[0.66em] align-[0.02em] transition-transform duration-150 group-hover:translate-x-px group-hover:-translate-y-px'
  width='10'
  height='10'
  viewBox='0 0 10 10'
  fill='none'
  aria-hidden='true'
>
  <path d='M2.5 7.5l5-5M3.5 2.5h4v4' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'></path>
</svg>
